InferenceX™ benchmark data — attribution and provenance

The benchmark rows under `data/` are sourced from InferenceX™ (formerly
InferenceMAX), an open-source continuous-inference benchmark platform
maintained by SemiAnalysis LLC.

  Source repository: https://github.com/SemiAnalysisAI/InferenceX
  Live dashboard:    https://inferencex.com/
  Public API:        https://inferencex.semianalysis.com/api/v1/benchmarks?model=<model>
                     (one request per model, e.g. ?model=gpt-oss-120b; the
