Per Apache 2.0 §4 attribution requirement and the upstream's explicit
attribution policy, any work derived from this data must:

  1. Preserve the LICENSE and this NOTICE file with redistribution.
  2. Cite InferenceX™ as the data source in publications and dashboards.
  3. Use the official SemiAnalysisAI/InferenceX repo as the canonical
     reference; explicitly label any third-party reproductions as
     "Unofficial" if not from the upstream repo.

This subdirectory of llm_perf vendors a snapshot of the public API for
offline analysis. The snapshot is regenerated from upstream via
`fetch.py`. No InferenceX source code is vendored here — only the
publicly published benchmark measurement rows. Snapshots are not edited
in place; if InferenceX corrects or backfills a measurement, re-run
`fetch.py` to refresh.

The code that compares this data with model predictions (model-spec
mappings, validation drivers) lives outside this directory, under
`benchmark/validate/`, and is not part of the InferenceX dataset.
